OL,5,G1500 Celtic Christie: The Unexpected
OL,6,G     Guest
OL,7,     FWhen a stranger appears at an
OL,8,     Fisolated house in Scotland, he
OL,9,     Fdiscovers a woman standing over
OL,10,     Fthe body of her husband, gun in
OL,11,     Fhand. It looks like a
OL,12,     Fstraightforward case of murder.
OL,13,G1600 Take Four Books
OL,14,     FThe best-selling American author
OL,15,     FJohn Grisham speaks about his
OL,16,     Fnovel, The French Illusion, and,
OL,17,     Ftogether with presenter James
OL,18,     FCrawford, they explore its links
OL,19,     Fto three other works.
